  "_comment_colors": "PROCESS: neutral-* is the raw grayscale ramp. Semantic tokens (surface-*, text-*, border-*) alias into it via var(--colors-neutral-N). Status tokens (success/warning/danger/info) each ship a base + -bg/-border/-text trio for blocks like alert and badge. liturgical-* maps directly onto ordo.LiturgicalOccasion.colour's five choices (violet/red/green/white/rose) — the template sets a per-page --accent custom property to one of these five values when a Service/Occasion is in context; pages with no occasion in view fall back to action-primary.",
